# Basic sensor array. Installed on a sensor hardpoint it multiplies the hull's
# baseline detection radii per layer (layer0 layer1 layer2).
id surveyor_mk1
name "Surveyor Array Mk I"
type sensor
size S
glyph S1
sensor_mult 1.15 1.35 1.60
desc "A basic phased array that stretches every sensor layer. The difference between finding a claim and flying past it."
